<title>USA: National Record Jan same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>National Record Jan same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Record Mart Inc said Thursday that total sales increased 4.6 percent for the four week period ending January 25, compared to the same four week period ending January 27, 1996.</p>
<p>Sales at stores on a comparative basis, those open for at least one year, were up 4.8 percent  as compared to the same four week period of the prior year.</p>
